    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH7x2021-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">Originating from the Eastern Sea,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">incomparable, it cannot be done."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">The *wutong* tree of Yuzhang, the plum of Moling.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">"Collected Works of Fan Ning‧Memorial Presented Upon Becoming the Governor of Yuzhang":</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">"Bai Yong patrolled the dukedom,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">minister Xiang Wan reached understanding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">It is said that two *li* northwest of the county, there is a forest,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">within the forest is a *wutong* tree.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">The roots below are separated by two *zhang*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">the branches above are separated by one *zhang* and eight *chi*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-68a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">joined together as one."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-69a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-69a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">The Book of Qi says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-69a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">"In the fourth year of Yongming,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-69a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">in Moling, there was a plum tree with intertwined branches."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-69a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">It also says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-69a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">"In the garden of Monk Xiu, four trees together became one trunk."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-69a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">Why abounding majesty? Why spreading joy?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-70a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-70a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">Sun's "Chart of Auspicious Responses" says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-70a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">"The ruler and ministers each have proper etiquette,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-70a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">the ruler pities those below,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-70a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">those below serve those above,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-70a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">then *wei wei* is produced."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-70a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">One version says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-70a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">"When the ruler's etiquette reaches perfection, then it is produced."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-70a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">It also says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-70a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">"When the ruler cherishes human life, then it is produced."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-71a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-71a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">"Apocryphal Text of the Classic of Filial Piety" says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-71a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">"When the ruler's filial virtue is a model for the four seas,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-71a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">virtue penetrates the deep darkness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-71a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">the eight directions are transformed by the spirits,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2021_CHANT_002-71a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-16T19:48:57.793+09:00">and together they flourish in widespread joy."</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
